| # | Decision | Options | Recommendation |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Featured-only vs. all installations on Home timeline | Featured only / All published | **Featured only** — highlight reel, not duplicate of `/work` |
| 2 | Step spacing on curve | Even spacing / Time-accurate (by year gap) | **Even spacing** — point is tactile interaction, not calendar accuracy |
| 3 | Mobile behavior | Pinned dial (won't work on touch) / Vertical stack with fade / Horizontal swipe | Must decide before build — desktop-only risks broken mobile shipping by default |
| 4 | Click sound in v1 | Include / Defer | **Defer** — bolt on after visual snap feels right |

